        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>Developed with Seatopia King Salmon &mdash; 8.5 oz skin-on, sushi-grade Ora King portions rich enough to stand up to hot honey. Alpine King and Atlantic Salmon work under the same treatment; just pull them a minute or two earlier, and a <a href=\"/products/digital-thermometer\" title=\"Digital Thermometer\">digital thermometer</a> removes the guesswork entirely.</p>",
