        "heading_tag": "h2",
        "subheading": "",
        "description": "<p>One pre-step, and it matters: pull the King Salmon out of the freezer the night before and thaw it in the refrigerator, or give it about an hour on the counter before you cook. After that, work in this order and everything lands hot at once.</p>",
