        "mp_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The sweet potato rounds keep 4 days refrigerated and reheat beautifully in the air fryer &mdash; 3 minutes at 375&deg;F and they crisp back up. The cucumber and tomato salad is best on days one and two before the cucumber starts to weep. Spinach, obviously, keeps as long as the bag says.</p><p>The salmon is the part worth cooking fresh, because 10 minutes is not much of a shortcut to save. That said, leftovers are genuinely good cold the next day &mdash; flake them over the same salad and skip the reheat entirely.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
